{"code":"PK30","wikidata":"Q123537773","wikipedia":{"en":"Min Buri MRT station","th":"สถานีมีนบุรี"},"summary":{"en":"Min Buri station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Soi Ramkhamhaeng 190/4, adjacent to Ramkhamhaeng Road in Min Buri district, Bangkok. The station has four exits, has a park and ride facility and is also the location of the Pink Line Depot.","th":"สถานีมีนบุรี เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพูซึ่งจะเชื่อมต่อกับสายสีส้มในอนาคต ยกระดับบนซอยรามคำแหง 190/4 ถนนรามคำแหง ในพื้นที่เขตมีนบุรี กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5.jpg/960px-%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5.jpg","author":"Maprangsriwutchai","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Min_Buri_Station_%28Orange_line%29.jpg/960px-Min_Buri_Station_%28Orange_line%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Min_Buri_Station_(Orange_line).jpg","author":"Reversemos.sapanaht","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/MRT_Orange_Line_Min_Buri_Station_20231203.jpg/960px-MRT_Orange_Line_Min_Buri_Station_20231203.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Orange_Line_Min_Buri_Station_20231203.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/c